"high_level_description": "A vertical medium-close indoor portrait of a young East Asian woman seated on a bed, facing the camera with a soft closed-lip smile and relaxed half-open eyes. Her head tilts toward frame-right, one arm is raised overhead with the thumb pointing downward beside her hair, and the other arm extends diagonally toward the lower foreground under strong warm sunlight from the upper-left.",
"style_description": {
"aesthetics": "Casual sunlit bedroom portrait photography with a candid everyday feeling, natural youthful presence, asymmetric pose, warm pink-beige color harmony, and an unforced intimate mood. Preserve the original ordinary facial proportions, mild under-eye fullness, loose flyaway hair, soft sweater bulk, and slightly overbright highlight behavior without cosmetic beautification or stylized glamour.",
"lighting": "Direct warm sunlight enters from the upper-left front at close range, creating the brightest illumination on the raised hand, the upper-left sleeve, the top of the bangs, forehead, nose bridge, frame-right cheek, neck, collar edge, shoulder, and the forward sleeve. Soft ambient room bounce keeps the facial shadows readable. Shadows fall beneath the chin, across the far side of the face, the lower torso, and the inner sleeve folds. Highlights on the pink knit and white bedding approach mild clipping with soft bloom, while the background wall stays evenly lit and warm.",
"photo": "Digital photography from a slightly low camera height with a close natural-portrait lens feel around 50mm, shot in a vertical medium crop from the upper thighs to just above the raised hand. The subject fills most of the frame and sits slightly right of center. Focus is placed on the eyes and face with moderate depth separation, while the background remains softly clear rather than heavily blurred. The image shows clean digital capture, gentle highlight halation, lifted warm shadows, preserved skin texture without retouching, visible stray hairs, soft knit fiber rendering, and no added sharpening or beauty smoothing.",
