"compositional_deconstruction": {
"background": "A simple bedroom setting with a smooth warm beige wall filling the upper background, a dark brown wooden headboard crossing the mid-lower rear plane, and soft white pillows and bedding occupying the lower background. The environment is uncluttered and softly secondary, serving only as a domestic anchor behind the seated subject.",
"elements": [
