"desc": "A young East Asian woman sits on the bed in a vertical medium-close portrait, positioned slightly right of center. Her torso turns slightly toward frame-left while her face turns toward the camera. Her chin lifts mildly and her head tilts toward frame-right. She wears a soft closed-lip smile, both eyes relaxed and half open, with gently raised cheeks and a calm playful expression. The frame-left arm rises overhead from the upper-left corner, elbow bent and hand near the top of her head, fingers curled loosely with the thumb clearly pointing downward. The other arm extends diagonally toward the lower foreground, creating slight foreshortening and occupying the lower center of the frame. She has dark brown to black hair tied loosely back, with wispy straight bangs across the forehead, loose strands around both cheeks and neck, and numerous sunlit flyaways around the crown and ponytail. She wears an oversized fuzzy pastel pink crew-neck knit sweater with ribbed collar, cuffs, and hem, decorated with dark charcoal-grey and off-white Nordic geometric bands across the chest, upper sleeves, lower sleeves, and hemline. A dark plaid skirt is partially visible near the bottom edge, with a small area of bare thigh at the lower-right. The sweater hangs loosely with dropped shoulders, broad sleeves, soft bunching at the elbows, and bright sun catching the fluffy knit surface. Skin remains natural and lightly textured, with no reshaping, no exaggerated eye enlargement, and no beautified facial refinement.",
